<title>USA: Financial Bancorp COO Greco resigns.</title>
<headline>Financial Bancorp COO Greco resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONG ISLAND CITY, N.Y. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Bancorp Inc said on Thursday its chief operating officer, Irene Greco, resigned to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>The company said its chief financial officer, P. James O'Gorman, will now be responsible for branch operations, and Valerie Swaya has been named chief administrative officer.</p>
<p>Financial Bancorp is the parent of Financial Federal Savings Bank.</p>
